WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.550
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:18.350
Let's go explore that way later.

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:19.720
No thanks.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:23.730
We might meet
those ghosts you love so much.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.560
Dad's late.

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:27.110
What was that?!

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.570
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:10.710
Mana-chan!

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:15.300
Mana-chan!

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:24.220
CHAPTER 60

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:29.060
PITCH-BLACK COLDNESS
THE <i>YOKAI</i> BURU-BURU

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:36.740
So pretty!

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:40.240
Oh wow! It's so pretty!

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.200
Beautiful!

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:43.870
Fantastic! Right, Yuta?

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:46.580
Come on, get with the program!

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:48.000
Beautiful!

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:49.710
Fantastic!

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:51.250
Switching to...

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:52.540
Yahoo!

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:53.880
Yahoo-hoo!

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:54.960
Yahoo-hoo-hoo!

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:56.460
Shut up!

00:02:56.590 --> 00:02:58.470
Keep it down in the car!

00:02:58.590 --> 00:02:59.970
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:03.010
Honestly. They can answer properly, but...

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:07.600
Relax, Mana. We're going camping today.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.230
Camping, huh?

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:12.520
Sorry for dragging you along, Yuta-kun.

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:13.980
Oh, it's fine.

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:19.740
Mom had to cancel but Dad kept
whining that he didn't want to cancel.

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:24.240
WELCOME TO THE HOLY MOUNTAIN
CHIOKAGADANI HOT SPRINGS

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:24.240
Ooh, there's hot springs here!

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:26.830
Mister, can we drop by on the way back?

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:29.040
Sure. That sounds good.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.490
Yuta.

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:09.660
Yuta's reactions are the best!

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.120
Come on, you scared me!

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:14.040
It's just a praying mantis.

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:18.920
You're fine with <i>yokai</i> and ghosts,
but otherwise you're such a coward!

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:20.510
Hey!

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:22.880
Picking on Yuta-kun again!

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:24.640
We're not picking on him!

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:25.760
Mana-chan.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:27.970
Look at him, he's scared!

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:31.850
It's the other side of friendship.
Heartful communication.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.020
Good friends!

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:35.060
What? That's absurd!

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:38.570
Then you don't mind being
good friends with my fist, do you?

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:41.030
What?! Talk about absurd!

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:51.910
Okay, time to pick things up.
Everyone dig in!

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:55.000
Looks delicious!

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.080
Let's eat!

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:01.380
Yummy!

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:04.680
I'm so happy I might cry!

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:06.470
I get it! It's so moving!

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:08.050
Yum, yum!

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:10.390
Be sure to eat up, Yuta-kun.

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:11.390
Okay!

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.770
-Everybody eat up!
-Hey is that one burned?

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:16.850
Don't eat just meat! Have some veggies!

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:33.500
Boys, could you bring some more firewood?

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:34.870
Okay!

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:01.570
What's that?

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:06.450
A scroll? Oh well.

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:08.030
Souma, let's go!

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:09.160
Sure!

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:30.220
Yuta.

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:35.020
Let's go explore that way later.

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:37.520
What? N-No thanks.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:39.350
Don't be like that.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:43.520
We might meet
those ghosts you love so much.

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:48.530
There might be dangerous ghosts.
I don't want to.

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:50.820
You chicken.

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:51.910
C'mon.

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:53.120
But...

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:54.450
Again?!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:56.830
Teasing Yuta-kun again!

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.790
We're not teasing him.

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:01.170
Can't you see he's unhappy?

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:04.590
Stop taking advantage of his gentleness!

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:07.010
If Yuta didn't like it, he'd say so!

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:10.300
What do you mean?!
I've told you to stop a million times!

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:13.220
No you haven't! I've been counting!

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:15.850
What is this?

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:17.430
What's that?

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:19.770
Ugh, what a freaky picture.

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:21.350
Gross.

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:28.030
What?

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:29.860
I wanted to look at it.

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.070
Why?

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:35.370
It might have been a picture of a <i>yokai</i>.

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:45.670
I'm going to the parking lot to get
our sleeping bags from the car.

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:47.840
Watch the fire will you?

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.340
Okay!

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.920
It's cold!

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.720
What was that?

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:39.100
Oh! The sleeping bags.

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.490
What was that?!

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:07.080
I'm getting sleepy.

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:09.590
Dad's late.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.380
I'll go check on him.

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:13.880
Me too.

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:14.840
Sure.

00:09:14.970 --> 00:09:16.220
Hey, wait.

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:26.230
What's that?

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:30.070
The sleeping bags.

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:32.070
What happened here?

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:35.030
Where did Mr. Inuyama go?

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:40.370
Souma, did it suddenly get real cold?

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:42.620
What? Of course not.

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:44.870
We should go tell Mana.

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:55.880
R-R-Run, Hiroto!

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:58.300
Wait up, Souma!

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:04.810
Help me!

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:07.770
-No!
-Get away!

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:12.360
Souma! Hiroto!

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:17.820
What was that voice?

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:22.240
Mana-chan, this might be a <i>yokai</i>'s doing.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:25.870
Yeah. I should contact Cat-san.

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:37.630
Mana-chan!

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:41.220
<i>"Attacked by </i>yokai<i>! Help!"</i>

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:46.680
Mana-chan!

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:51.980
BURU-BURU

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:07.200
Mana-chan...

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:11.460
BURU-BURU

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:15.960
SOUND ASLEEP

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:14.960
-<i>"I sense </i>yokai<i> activity."</i>
-<i>"What'd I do?"</i>

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:15.960
<i>"I didn't see that..."</i>

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:20.220
Kitaro!

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:24.220
Mana's in trouble!

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:30.060
<i>A </i>yokai<i> took Mana-chan.</i>

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:34.360
<i>She probably got everyone else, too.</i>

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:37.280
<i>I have to help them!</i>

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:41.360
<i>But how?</i>

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:45.120
<i>I'm all alone.</i>

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:51.120
<i>It's pitch-black ahead.</i>

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:53.920
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:57.630
<i>Mana-chan isn't here.</i>

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.170
<i>No one is.</i>

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:12.560
I'm sorry...

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:24.160
Yuta-kun.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:27.490
What happened?

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:30.330
Well...

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:38.500
That sounds like the work of
the <i>yokai</i>, Buru-Buru.

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:41.010
What's that? What a funny name.

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:42.340
Buru-Buru...

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:45.050
My grandma told me about her.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:48.760
A <i>yokai</i> that scares people
and causes chills.

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:50.520
Yes, that's right.

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:53.520
Buru-Buru, otherwise known as
the Spirit of Cowardice.

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:57.980
She used to cause trouble for humans
on mountain roads.

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:57.980
SHIVER, SHIVER, SHIVER

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:07.200
I'd heard she was sealed away in a scroll.

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:13.330
I'm sorry. We burned that scroll.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.080
You burned it?!

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:19.590
She's a difficult <i>yokai</i> and sealing her
away is the only way to deal with her.

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:23.630
But why wasn't Yuta-kun attacked?

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:25.590
She hates fire.

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:31.010
Yuta-kun was close to the fire,
that's probably why he was safe.

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:33.480
Are Mana and the others okay?

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:38.980
Let's search around here first.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.540
Are you okay, Yuta-kun?

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:02.920
What's wrong, Yuta-kun?

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:08.550
At times like this,
Mana-chan would always protect me.

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:15.640
That's why, when Mana-chan was
taken by Buru-Buru,

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:18.560
it was supposed to be my turn to help her.

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:26.150
And yet...
I was so scared and couldn't move...

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:35.870
Let's go.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.120
Okay.

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:39.000
Um...

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:46.010
Kitaro-san, don't you ever get scared
fighting dangerous <i>yokai</i>?

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:50.470
I feel scared at times.

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:51.970
Huh? Then why?

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:57.810
When things happen between
<i>yokai</i> and humans, I can't leave it alone.

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.100
That's my purpose.

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:12.120
Yuta-kun!

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:26.880
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:15:30.550 --> 00:15:34.140
When invisible, Buru-Buru can't be
detected by the naked eye.

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:39.270
Put on the Yokai Glasses to find her
and stop her movements.

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:40.600
Yes, Dad!

00:15:58.410 --> 00:15:59.540
There she is.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:01.330
Don't let her detect you.

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:02.880
Yes, Dad.

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:09.920
Hair Needles.

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:18.180
Well done, Kitaro.
This should keep her from moving about.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:19.640
Indeed.

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:22.940
Are you okay, Yuta-kun?

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:24.100
Yes.

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:26.270
Let's find Mana and the others first.

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:29.110
They might be being held near here.

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:32.150
I was rescued again...

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:34.360
Yuta-kun, let's go.

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:35.820
Oh, right.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:46.340
A little more...

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:48.630
It's no good.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:50.420
Anyone!

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:52.090
Please help us!

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:53.220
Help!

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:55.220
Is anyone there?

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:57.350
Mana.

00:16:57.470 --> 00:16:58.600
Kitaro!

00:16:58.890 --> 00:16:59.770
Thank you.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:00.720
It's nothing.

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:01.930
Thank goodness!

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.730
The air's sweet.

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:05.310
Mana-chan...

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:06.360
Yuta-kun.

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:07.310
Um...

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.650
Are you okay? Were you hurt?

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:11.940
Thank goodness you're safe.

00:17:12.070 --> 00:17:13.360
Yeah...

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:18.780
We're going back to Buru-Buru
and figuring out how to seal her away.

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:20.660
Thank you, Kitaro!

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:22.370
Thank you very much!

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:26.000
Kitaro-san!

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:28.920
How can I...

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:31.210
How can I get stronger?

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:34.260
I'm tired of being protected all the time.

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:37.010
Yuta-kun.

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:41.220
All humans have
a weakness in their hearts.

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:45.270
But, at times, they can
show great strength, too.

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:51.070
It's when they think, not for themselves,
but for others.

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:57.030
The wish to protect someone
is what gives people strength.

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:02.160
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
What's the deal?! Acting all savage!

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:04.960
Let's make a profit together!

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:14.630
Cold, cold, cold, cold!

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:17.800
Oh crap, I'm gonna die!

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:21.350
Thank goodness!

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:22.600
Rat Man?!

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:24.270
What happened here?

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:26.350
Kitaro...

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:29.860
Buru-Buru's missing!

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:36.820
<i>All humans have
a weakness in their hearts.</i>

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:42.740
Dad, what's wrong?!

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:53.710
Mana!

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:57.260
Mana-chan!

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:02.010
But...

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:05.470
I feel scared at times.

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:11.610
The wish to protect someone
is what gives people strength.

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:15.030
Stop, Buru-Buru!

00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:20.070
You're just a <i>yokai</i> that
gives people chills!

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:22.910
I'm not scared of you anymore!

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:25.410
Give Mana-chan back!

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:30.170
Come on!

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:43.470
Yuta-kun!

00:19:43.930 --> 00:19:45.680
-What do we do?!
-Yuta!

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:46.810
Mana!

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:48.810
Kitaro! Yuta-kun was...!

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:52.560
We have to get her out
or he'll freeze to death!

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:54.020
Freeze to death?!

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:55.610
Hot springs...

00:19:57.610 --> 00:19:59.570
Man, what an ordeal.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:02.570
I'm lucky there was this hot spring.

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:04.780
Absolute bliss.

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:09.330
What?!

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:12.580
What gives, Kitaro?!

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:16.090
-Yuta!
-Yuta-kun!

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:19.840
Buru-Buru, I won't lose to you!

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:23.470
This is bad!

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.350
Cold!

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:28.350
Add more hot water
to increase the temperature!

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:30.230
I'll go ask them to!

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:36.480
Good, the water temperature's rising.

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:45.990
Buru-Buru is in pain from the heat!

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:50.250
-Yuta-kun!
-Yuta!

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:51.500
-Yuta!
-Hang in there!

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:53.830
She's coming out of his mouth, Kitaro!

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:54.880
Right!

00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:59.130
Now!

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:07.970
Yuta-kun!

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:12.980
Everyone...

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:15.810
Thank goodness!

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:17.770
I-I can't breathe.

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:19.650
Oh, sorry!

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:22.900
Thank goodness!

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:28.910
With this incident, I'm sure Yuta-kun
has gained some confidence.

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:30.700
Indeed.

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:37.420
Hey, Yuta!

00:21:44.760 --> 00:21:46.800
Your reactions are the best!

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:49.810
You startled me, guys.

00:21:50.180 --> 00:21:52.270
Can I see that?

00:21:52.390 --> 00:21:53.230
Sure.

00:21:53.520 --> 00:21:54.600
It's cute!

00:21:54.730 --> 00:21:56.100
No it's not.

00:21:56.230 --> 00:21:57.400
Yes it is!

00:21:57.520 --> 00:21:59.270
You're in the minority there...

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>You're a dream
My dream</i>

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>kimi wa yume boku no yume</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>I'm dreaming in a dream</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>yume no naka de yume miteiru</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>Let's stay like this forever</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>itsumade mo kono mama de imashou</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.300
<i>You blur and begin to fade</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.300
<i>kasuka kimi ga nijimu</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:35.020
<i>Don't you cry
Where did you come from?</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:35.020
<i>Don't you cry anata wa doko kara kitano?</i>

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>A masquerade
Faceless faces laugh</i>

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>kamenbutou kao no nai kao ga warau</i>

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>Hee-hee-hee</i>

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>fufufu</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>In dreams, in dreams
Lost in dreams</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>yume ni yume ni yume ni samayoi</i>

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:48.160
<i>kuru kuru to mawaru</i>

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:48.160
<i>Twirling around</i>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>dare mo odoru odoru ai wo sagashite</i>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>Everyone dancing, dancing
Looking for love</i>

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO mawareyo maware yume yume</i>

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO, spin, spin
Dream, dream</i>

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.170
<i>Nickel Kana of The Batteries?
Dad, who is she again?</i>

00:23:08.430 --> 00:23:10.760
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:10.890 --> 00:23:13.140
<i>"Tofu-Kozo's Mold Pandemic"</i>

00:23:13.260 --> 00:23:15.600
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
